This assert statement is related to the comment "@@@ Capacity of the list is increased to twice the previous capacity or the new size, whichever is larger." This comment is related to the capacity of the array in the ArrayList class. The statement "OLD(_items.Length) <= _items.Length" ensures that the capacity of the list is not reduced after adding elements to it.
